[{"content":"You can call these tools (parameters are JSON Schema; \"required\" lists the required arguments, and \"default\" is the value used when an optional argument is left out):\n\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Messaging_1_ShareLocation\",\n    \"description\": \"Shares the current geographical location with a specified contact.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"location\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The current location to share, expressed in the format 'Latitude, Longitude' (e.g., '34.052235, -118.243683').\"\n        },\n        \"contact_name\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The full name of the contact to whom the location will be sent.\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"location\",\n        \"contact_name\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"get_order_status\",\n    \"description\": \"Look up an order placed in our store: its items, payment state, shipping carrier and tracking number.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"order_id\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Store order id, formatted like 'ORD-123456'.\"\n        },\n        \"include\": {\n          \"type\": \"array\",\n          \"description\": \"Extra sections to include in the response, in any order.\",\n          \"items\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\",\n            \"description\": \"Section name.\",\n            \"enum\": [\n              \"items\",\n              \"payments\",\n              \"shipping\",\n              \"returns\"\n            ]\n          }\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"order_id\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"deleteFile\",\n    \"description\": \"Delete one file by path; by default it is moved to the trash, where it can still be restored.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"path\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Absolute path of the file to delete, exactly as listed.\"\n        },\n        \"permanent\": {\n          \"type\": \"boolean\",\n          \"description\": \"Delete permanently instead of moving the file to the trash.\",\n          \"default\": false\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"path\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"cancel_order\",\n    \"description\": \"Cancel a store order that has not been delivered yet and refund it to the chosen payment method.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"order_id\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Store order id, formatted like 'ORD-123456'.\"\n        },\n        \"reason\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Why the customer is cancelling, used for reporting.\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"changed_mind\",\n            \"found_cheaper\",\n            \"ordered_by_mistake\",\n            \"arrives_too_late\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"refund_method\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Where the refund is paid: the original card or store credit.\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"original_payment\",\n            \"store_credit\"\n          ],\n          \"default\": \"original_payment\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"order_id\",\n        \"reason\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"track_package\",\n    \"description\": \"Get the delivery status and scan history of a parcel from its carrier and tracking number.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"carrier\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Shipping carrier that holds the parcel, in lower case.\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"ups\",\n            \"fedex\",\n            \"dhl\",\n            \"usps\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"tracking_number\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The carrier's tracking number, exactly as given, digits as a string.\"\n        },\n        \"language\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Language of the scan descriptions in the response.\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"en\",\n            \"es\",\n            \"fr\",\n            \"de\"\n          ],\n          \"default\": \"en\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"carrier\",\n        \"tracking_number\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"Travel_1_FindAttractions\",\n    \"description\": \"Browse attractions in a given city, filtering by various criteria such as free entry, category, and suitability for children.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"location\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The name of the city or town where the attraction is located, in the format of 'City, State' or 'City, Country', such as 'Paris, France' or 'New York, NY'.\"\n        },\n        \"free_entry\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Flag indicating whether the attraction offers free entry. A value of 'True' filters for attractions with free entry, 'False' for attractions with an entry fee, and 'dontcare' (default) includes all attractions regardless of entry fee.\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"True\",\n            \"False\",\n            \"dontcare\"\n          ],\n          \"default\": \"dontcare\"\n        },\n        \"category\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Category of the attraction, such as 'Place of Worship', 'Theme Park', etc. Use 'dontcare' (default) to include all categories.\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"Place of Worship\",\n            \"Theme Park\",\n            \"Museum\",\n            \"Historical Landmark\",\n            \"Park\",\n            \"Tourist Attraction\",\n            \"Sports Venue\",\n            \"Shopping Area\",\n            \"Performing Arts Venue\",\n            \"Nature Preserve\",\n            \"dontcare\"\n          ],\n          \"default\": \"dontcare\"\n        },\n        \"good_for_kids\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"Flag indicating whether the attraction is suitable for children. 'True' filters for kid-friendly attractions, 'False' for attractions that may not be suitable for children, and 'dontcare' (default) includes all attractions.\",\n          \"enum\": [\n            \"True\",\n            \"False\",\n            \"dontcare\"\n          ],\n          \"default\": \"dontcare\"\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"location\"\n      ]\n    }\n  },\n  {\n    \"name\": \"get_pods\",\n    \"description\": \"Retrieves a list of all pods within a specified namespace in a Kubernetes cluster.\",\n    \"parameters\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\",\n      \"properties\": {\n        \"namespace\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"The namespace from which to retrieve pods. For example, 'default' or 'kube-system'.\"\n        },\n        \"label_selector\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"A selector to restrict the list of returned objects by their labels. Defaults to everything if not specified.\",\n          \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        \"field_selector\": {\n          \"type\": \"string\",\n          \"description\": \"A selector to restrict the list of returned objects by their fields. Defaults to everything if not specified.\",\n          \"default\": \"\"\n        },\n        \"include_uninitialized\": {\n          \"type\": \"boolean\",\n          \"description\": \"If true, partially initialized resources are included in the response.\",\n          \"default\": false\n        }\n      },\n      \"required\": [\n        \"namespace\"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n]\n\nRequest: What's happening with my order ORD-123014?\n\nReply with only a JSON array of the tool calls that fulfil the request, each of the form {\"name\": \"<tool name>\", \"arguments\": {...}}, where \"arguments\" is a JSON object (not a string). When the request needs several calls, list them all. Reply with [] if no tool fits the request, or if the request does not give a value for a required argument: never guess one. Include every required argument. Include an optional argument only if the request asks for a value for it; otherwise leave it out and the tool applies its default. Give each value the type its schema declares: JSON numbers for integer and number, true or false for boolean, and strings for string, copied exactly as written.","role":"user"},{"content":"[{\"name\":\"get_order_status\",\"arguments\":{\"order_id\":\"ORD-123014\"}}]","role":"assistant"},{"content":"Tool results:\n[\n  {\n    \"name\": \"get_order_status\",\n    \"result\": {\n      \"order_id\": \"ORD-123014\",\n      \"status\": \"shipped\",\n      \"carrier\": \"dhl\",\n      \"tracking_number\": \"54982083485\"\n    }\n  }\n]\n\nRequest: Where is that parcel right now?\n\nReply as before: only a JSON array of tool calls, or [] if no tool fits or a required value is missing.","role":"user"}]